  "storyPlan": {
    "premise": "What if creating short-form videos took only 2 minutes?\n\nA promotional concept introducing TikMaker as an AI-powered tool that transforms simple ideas into ready-to-publish vertical videos. The video highlights the time-consuming process of traditional content creation, including brainstorming, scriptwriting, finding visuals, editing and animating. It then introduces TikMaker, demonstrating how the platform automates these steps and generates a complete motion graphics video from a single idea. The goal is to attract content creators, faceless creators and social media marketers while testing whether they would be interested in using such a tool."
  },
